= The St Valentine's Day Concordat

The government and the TUC announce a joint statement on the economy, promptly nicknamed the St Valentine's Day Concordat. The strikes begin to fade as the weather warms.

The damage, though, is done. Voters who lived through the winter won't quickly forget it.
